    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Become the best chef in the world!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Kitchen Quest you can prepare over 50 delicious dishes - in your own fully equipped dream kitchen! From frying pans to deep fryers, everything a real chef needs is included. And don't forget: Your restaurant should be just as impressive as your food - otherwise guests will leave before you can even serve them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Everything a chef's heart desires</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your kitchen has more than 50 different ingredients for you to get creative with. Cook, fry, bake and surprise your guests with a varied menu that leaves nothing to be desired.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Watch out, the kitchen may catch fire!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be warned: in the hustle and bustle of a real professional kitchen, things can quickly go wrong. A steak on the grill for too long? You've got a problem! In Kitchen Quest, every second counts - and your guests have little patience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Critical guests, real challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers are merciless in their judgement. A late order or a dish that doesn't meet their expectations will have an immediate impact on your rating. Some never give you a second chance, others remain silent - but don't come back. Learn to deal with pressure and keep improving your restaurant.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The critics are coming!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite up to 7 different restaurant critics to take your restaurant to the next level. If they like your food, they'll share their secret favourite recipes with you - which you can then sell yourself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fancy cooking without the stress?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then sandbox mode is just the thing. All recipes are unlocked immediately, you can take your time to embellish your restaurant - and annoying guests who run away because of every little thing stay outside. Perfect for creative, relaxed play.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Become the best chef in the world!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Kitchen Quest you can prepare over 50 delicious dishes - in your own fully equipped dream kitchen! From frying pans to deep fryers, everything a real chef needs is included. And don't forget: Your restaurant should be just as impressive as your food - otherwise guests will leave before you can even serve them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Everything a chef's heart desires</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your kitchen has more than 50 different ingredients for you to get creative with. Cook, fry, bake and surprise your guests with a varied menu that leaves nothing to be desired.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Watch out, the kitchen may catch fire!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be warned: in the hustle and bustle of a real professional kitchen, things can quickly go wrong. A steak on the grill for too long? You've got a problem! In Kitchen Quest, every second counts - and your guests have little patience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Critical guests, real challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers are merciless in their judgement. A late order or a dish that doesn't meet their expectations will have an immediate impact on your rating. Some never give you a second chance, others remain silent - but don't come back. Learn to deal with pressure and keep improving your restaurant.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The critics are coming!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite up to 7 different restaurant critics to take your restaurant to the next level. If they like your food, they'll share their secret favourite recipes with you - which you can then sell yourself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fancy cooking without the stress?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then sandbox mode is just the thing. All recipes are unlocked immediately, you can take your time to embellish your restaurant - and annoying guests who run away because of every little thing stay outside. Perfect for creative, relaxed play.</p>",
    "short_description": "Become the best chef in the world! Cook more than 50 dishes in your own kitchen with everything a chef needs. Automate your own restaurant with the help of employees and leave all the annoying tasks behind!",
